        GRTOT    LIKE MARD-LABST,
        GI01     LIKE MARD-LABST,    "판매출고
        GI02     LIKE MARD-LABST,    "이전출고
        GI03     LIKE MARD-LABST,    "폐기출고
        GI04     LIKE MARD-LABST,    "사내소비
        GI05     LIKE MARD-LABST,    "위탁보충
        GI06     LIKE MARD-LABST,    "기타출고
        GITOT    LIKE MARD-LABST,

