        WITH NON-UNIQUE KEY MATNR WERKS LGORT CHARG SOBKZ
                             VBELN POSNR LFGJA LFMON.
DATA: GT_MARDH_ALL TYPE SORTED TABLE OF MARDH
        WITH NON-UNIQUE KEY MATNR WERKS LGORT LFGJA LFMON.


